ar.\\n- Added preview and recording control for multiple compatible Android camera devices.\\n- Improved remote video frame pacing, reconnection, audio cleanup, and deletion reliability.\"", "created_date": 1785346449, "id": "27676560955346477", "version": "v338(2026.07.30_02:22)", "version_code": 338, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8767138216715369", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "24817356654600269"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "936000788427438"}]}, "change_log": "\"Major Update\\n- Added Android phone and PC screen mirroring and remote control through companion apps.\\n- Connect multiple remote windows to different devices and save each device assignment and spatial position.\\n- Added hand tracking and Touch controller support for taps, drags, scrolling, keyboard input, and right-click.\\n- Added 3D CAM stereoscopic MP4 recording on supported Quest headsets.\\n- Stereo MP4 formats are now detected automatically and rendered separately to each eye.\\n- Added VRMA timeline, pose, motion, and synchronized WAV audio editing.\\n- Added QR media scanning, GIF playback, MP4 thumbnails, and a seek bar.\\n- Added preview and recording control for multiple compatible Android camera devices.\\n- Improved remote video frame pacing, reconnection, audio cleanup, and deletion reliability.\"", "created_date": 1784738531, "id": "27595865273416046", "version": "v281(2026.07.23_01:34)", "version_code": 281, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_sym